{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p13000-6a83e7f5e25e390fd477","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"당신의 이미지를 쓴 광고판을 발견한다. 뻔뻔한 광고 문구에 당신은 깜짝 놀란다","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["14831777846825624880"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-f77b753e052fc7cf8192","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"당신의 시선이 머무는 것을 느낀 광고판이 당신을 바라본다. 시선이 당신의 얼굴을 지나치는 순간, 광고판은 너무 흥분한 나머지 그대로 다운될 뻔했다","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["13643149875648779902"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-f3c4b7c66ac7d6940ac2","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"왜 나랑 똑같이 생긴 거지?","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10242299073777471920","1696421772897058548"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-4b5604211dcdf53c5700","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"왜 나랑 똑같이 생긴 거지?","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1696421772897058548"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-f21e7bc170ed983808d5","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"이봐? 말 좀 해 봐!","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["15996443283459040711","8235303152564031375"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-ec7d1ab033fb6ef3e68d","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"이봐? 말 좀 해 봐!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8235303152564031375"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-d0a7b4dd91664bc0a028","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"……","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13348415815822187238"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-e61f5ce8ac722a51414b","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"광고판의 반응에 할 말을 잃는다. 이 광고판에는 반복 기능만 있는 건 아니겠지? 왜 계속 당신의 말을 따라 하는 것일까? 무슨 말을 해야 할지 모르겠다","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["12391902747782919413"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-33c7a93e9d35f2d45232","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"이 광고판에는 반복 기능만 있는 건 아니겠지? 왜 계속 내 말을 따라 하지? 무슨 말을 해야 할지 모르겠네","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["260245389058236592"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-20917093851ad893f221","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"(이런… 실수로 속마음을 말했어……)","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["11468939635143405147"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-8e0706ff9cdfedba6a74","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"전 앵무새가 아니에요! 선장님, 정말 당신인가요?! 무슨 마뤼든 햐보——아, 지성해요. 아직 선장님의 바음울 배우는——콜록, 콜록……","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["330414629998588944"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-623a0a93156a1323d357","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"콜록, 콜록콜록… 죄송해요. 아직 선장님 발음을 배우는 중이라서요. 직접 뵈니까 너무 흥분해서 혀가 꼬였어요!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10110991967220632819"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-974e9263b4ede388786a","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"선장님, 저를 보러 오신 건가요? 아니면 무슨 문제라도 있나요? 걱정 말고 속 시원하게 말씀하세요. 무슨 말씀이든 듣고 싶어요!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16783078055855871534"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-b5c616735eb0cd85cb44","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"왜 내 말을 학습하는 거야?","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["12780023582282606194"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-72b8367e38a412248a10","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"왜냐하면… 당신의 목소리가 너무 좋아서요. 전 따라 해도 별로 비슷하지 않고, 발음도 투박하게 처리하거든요. 선장님이 말씀하시는 걸 듣자마자 너무 배우고 싶었어요……","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["12368636977496091889"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-a89230079c26bfa58b8d","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"야거 는하라따 이같 보바 서래그?","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2453354855991795210","8000998301317212475"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-af65b941d65be6137ec2","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"선장님, 전 바보가 아니에요! 이런 식으로 괴롭히지 마세요! 제 모습을 보세요——저를 괴롭히는 것은 선장님 자신을 괴롭히는 거라고요!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9344014347183843487","18402339016119332546"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-5ff3ac4b44f9ca5fc7a2","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"내 얼굴을 파니까 장사는 잘 돼?","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["7419149962023954659","7622743682437424407"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-6c8012d1e0095648ba93","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"정확히는 모르지만, 절 보려고 오는 사람이 많아요. 선원들한테 사전 판매 반응이 아주 좋다는 얘기도 들었어요","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16384943051565701985","14259897121535335153"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-8914c36786ee5280ce3a","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"더 얘기할 건 없어","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10111518481704875810","4135995316475194518","4021390323052640703","4700378280141978415","10637336040760311495"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-171a0abf803b6b48911d","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"좀 더 얘기해 주세요. 목소리가 너무 좋아서 더 듣고 싶어요!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11520896119216347003","18268221394682235635"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-0f7b436edae7ce9684c1","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"더 할 말이 없어","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["1482352966629255183","17967156932630732248"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-e67efe003ba35f937f31","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","text":"음, 역시 선장님 목소리가 훨씬 좋네요…. 더 열심히 연습해야겠어요","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3369084944350315832","6633079591639469444"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p13000","title":"「미니 선장」","page":"「迷你船长」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p13000-6a83e7f5e25e390fd477","rowId":"other-npc-p13000-6a83e7f5e25e390fd477","missionId":"npc-p13000","mission":"「미니 선장」","sceneId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-d7790ca7a9c54afa4104d7ec","page":"「迷你船长」","revision":41919,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-f77b753e052fc7cf8192","rowId":"other-npc-p13000-f77b753e052fc7cf8192","missionId":"npc-p13000","mission":"「미니 선장」","sceneId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-ac0768625c9c8d4efa63aa7b","page":"「迷你船长」","revision":41919,"location":[2,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-f3c4b7c66ac7d6940ac2","rowId":"other-npc-p13000-f3c4b7c66ac7d6940ac2","missionId":"npc-p13000","mission":"「미니 선장」","sceneId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-6d1a63a2bc27a5ae2a0bfe4b","page":"「迷你船长」","revision":41919,"location":[4,0,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["938065ff3d7a-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p13000-4b5604211dcdf53c5700"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-4b5604211dcdf53c5700","rowId":"other-npc-p13000-4b5604211dcdf53c5700","missionId":"npc-p13000","mission":"「미니 선장」","sceneId":"s7b6b0c32b8814255","scene":"NPC 대사 1","contextId":"wiki-context-6d1a63a2bc27a5ae2a0bfe4b","page":"「迷你船长」","revision":41919,"location":[4,0,"reply",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["938065ff3d7a-0"],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":["other-npc-p13000-f3c4b7c66ac7d6940ac2